# pagecheck/Dockerfile's build context is the repository root: the web app's sources (the check builds a copy with the
# game's page) and the page check itself; no dependencies, builds or tests from the checkout
*
!web
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/test
web/next-env.d.ts
# never local secrets or deploy state
web/.env*
web/.vercel
web/**/*.pem
!pagecheck/package.json
!pagecheck/package-lock.json
!pagecheck/src
